{
 "_about": "A small Contoso-style model in the fair replay facts format (gather-fair.py), for the equivalence of the product question and the replay question. The node test builds the replay payload from it with build-calls-fair.mjs and maps it to the product payload by the stated mapping; the C# test builds the same model in the engine and must produce exactly that payload. Measures: Total Amount = SUM('Sales'[Amount]), Average Price = AVERAGE(Sales [Unit Price]); Sales[CustomerKey] is the many side of a relationship to Customer[CustomerKey]; Sales[Region] sorts by Sales[Region Order].",
